WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.684
Project B focuses on time grain The source table has
one row

00:00:05.698 --> 00:00:11.293
per order event We truncate the timestamp to month
then group at that

00:00:11.306 --> 00:00:17.167
new grain The output contains monthly order count
distinct customers

00:00:17.378 --> 00:00:23.125
revenue and average order value This is the kind of
feature table commonly

00:00:23.151 --> 00:00:25.230
used for dashboards or later modeling
